NOTE: box_utils.py's `decode` function carries a code comment crediting
https://github.com/Hakuyume/chainer-ssd, which itself has no license. However,
the identical function (same code, comments, and variable names) is also
present, under MIT, in https://github.com/amdegroot/ssd.pytorch and
https://github.com/biubug6/Pytorch_Retinaface — verified by direct comparison.
Provenance for this function is therefore traced through those MIT-licensed
repos rather than the unlicensed chainer-ssd origin. See
../../../THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for details.
